### Variables
@identityUrl = http://localhost:5001
@tasksUrl = http://localhost:5002

# After running "Login - demo user", copy the token here:
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

# After running "Create task", copy the id here:
@taskId = PASTE_TASK_ID_HERE


### ── Health ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Identity API health
GET {{identityUrl}}/api/health

###

### Tasks API health
GET {{tasksUrl}}/api/health


### ── Auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register a new user
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPass1!",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

###

### Login - demo user  (copy the token from the response into @token above)
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "DemoPass1!"
}

###

### Get current user profile  (requires token)
GET {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ── Tasks ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all tasks  (requires token)
GET {{tasksUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a task  (copy the id from the response into @taskId above)
POST {{tasksUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "My smoke test task",
  "description": "Created from api-test.http"
}

###

### Update a task
PUT {{tasksUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated task title",
  "description": "Updated from api-test.http",
  "isCompleted": true
}

###

### Delete a task
DELETE {{tasksUrl}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Tasks require auth - expect 401
GET {{tasksUrl}}/api/tasks
